PN,40301
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FThe Football Association has banned
OL,7,Fsolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,8,Fand announced funding for non-league
OL,9,Fclubs to improve their safety.
OL,11,FITV News understands that around 160
OL,12,Fclubs have been told to make changes
OL,13,Fout of approximately 900 that were
OL,14,Fassessed.
OL,16,FA safety review was finally
OL,17,Fcommissioned in late 2025, just weeks
OL,18,Fafter a young footballer lost his life.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FBilly Vigar was just 21 when he
OL,7,Fcollided with a wall whilst playing
OL,8,Ffor Chichester City FC. The death of
OL,9,Fthe former Arsenal academy graduate
OL,10,Fprompted a number of complaints from
OL,11,Fthose across the football community
OL,12,Fand from the Professional Footballer's
OL,13,FAssociation.
OL,15,FThat incident followed another high-
OL,16,Fprofile incident at Bath City in 2022.
OL,18,FFootballer Alex Fletcher almost died
OL,19,Fafter hitting his head against a
OL,20,Fconcrete wall around the pitch at
OL,21,FTwerton Park.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FHe was left fighting for his life in a
OL,7,Fcoma.
OL,9,FToday he welcomed the announcement and
OL,10,Furged the affected clubs to take
OL,11,Faction but also said he felt the
OL,12,Fpositive change had come too late.
OL,14,F"I have mixed emotions, whilst I
OL,15,Fwelcome the changes and think they are
OL,16,Frobust I hope they go far enough," he
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,19,F"I do think that the changes have come
OL,20,Ftoo late."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"I think the fact there is money
OL,7,Favailable for clubs to make these
OL,8,Fchanges is the most fundamental part
OL,9,Fof this. That will help clubs improve
OL,10,Fthe safety without going to the wall
OL,11,Fbecause a lot of these non-league
OL,12,Fclubs are not washed with cash.
OL,14,F"I am really pleased to see there is a
OL,15,Fpot of money available and now it is
OL,16,Freally important that those clubs
OL,17,Faffected makes these changes as soon
OL,18,Fas possible."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FIn a statement today the FA announced
OL,7,Ffunding would be provided to clubs so
OL,8,Fthey can improve the safety of their
OL,9,Ffootball stadiums right across the
OL,10,Fcountry.
OL,12,F"We have undertaken a review of pitch
OL,13,Fperimeter walls across the National
OL,14,FLeague System and Women's National
OL,15,FLeague to identify what improvements
OL,16,Fcan be made to our Stadium
OL,17,FAccreditation Criteria that will help
OL,18,Fclubs mitigate potential safety risks
OL,19,Fat their grounds and stadiums," an FA
OL,20,Fspokesperson said.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"As a result of this ongoing phased
OL,7,Freview, which has been conducted by
OL,8,Findependent Health and Safety experts,
OL,9,Fwe have updated our Stadium
OL,10,FAccreditation Criteria for the 2026/27
OL,11,Fseason.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"This includes introducing revised
OL,7,Fcriteria relating to pitch perimeter
OL,8,Fbarriers, which no longer permits
OL,9,Fsolid brick, breeze block or concrete
OL,10,Fbarriers around pitches across the
OL,11,FNational League System for men (Steps
OL,12,F1-6), and the Women's National League
OL,13,F(Tiers 3-4). Any existing solid brick,
OL,14,Fbreeze block or concrete barriers must
OL,15,Fbe removed as soon as reasonably
OL,16,Fpracticable, or covered with suitable
OL,17,Fprotection if they cannot be removed
OL,18,Ffor structural reasons. We have
OL,19,Finformed the clubs at this level that
OL,20,Fwill be required to take action as a
OL,21,Fresult of these changes.
OL,26,@sD@`pmtD@DpnuD@ApmuD@Kpn
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"Matches may continue to be played at
OL,7,Faffected grounds during this period;
OL,8,Fhowever, clubs should assess the
OL,9,Fsafety of their pitch perimeter
OL,10,Fbarriers on an ongoing basis.
OL,12,F"To support this important work, The
OL,13,FFA and the Premier League will provide
OL,14,Ffunding to facilitate these changes,
OL,15,Fwhich will be administered by the
OL,16,FPremier League Stadium Fund. The
OL,17,Finitial phase of the programme is
OL,18,Falready underway, and we will continue
OL,19,Fto provide full support to the clubs
OL,20,Finvolved in this process."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FITV News understands that during the
OL,7,Fsafety review approximately 900 clubs
OL,8,Fwere assessed across the country, with
OL,9,Fmore than 150 told to make
OL,10,Fimprovements as a result of the
OL,11,Ffindings.
OL,13,FThat announcement has come as welcome
OL,14,Fnews to the family of Ben, his father
OL,15,Fpraising the authorities for finally
OL,16,Ftaking action to 'protect its players'.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,FFollowing Friday's announcement, a PFA
OL,7,Fspokesperson said: "Following the
OL,8,Ftragic death of Billy Vigar last year,
OL,9,Fwe again highlighted these concerns
OL,10,Fand made clear our view that the lack
OL,11,Fof progress and leadership on this
OL,12,Fissue had been unacceptable.
OL,14,F"As part of working groups set up by
OL,15,Fthe FA following Billy's death, we
OL,16,Fpushed for the FA's Stadium
OL,17,FAccreditation criteria to be amended
OL,18,Fto ban these types of walls so that
OL,19,Fthere is a clear and centralised
OL,20,Fpolicy for clubs to follow.
OL,26,@oD@TOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"Given that, it's a welcome step that
OL,7,Fthe FA's regulations have now been
OL,8,Fchanged to reflect that position.
OL,10,F"However, it will now be important for
OL,11,Fprogress on the removal of such walls
OL,12,F` and effective mitigation of risks
OL,13,Fahead of their removal ` to be
OL,14,Fproperly monitored, and for clubs to
OL,15,Fbe given the support they need so that
OL,16,Fthese changes can happen as soon as
OL,17,Fpossible. Player safety must always
OL,18,Fcome first."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUzD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F'It is an historic day' - Those are
OL,7,Fthe words of another family who have
OL,8,Fbeen calling for urgent action from
OL,9,Ffootball's governing body for years.
OL,11,FClive Hiscox's son Ben died after
OL,12,Fcolliding with a clubhouse wall
OL,13,Fplaying football in Bristol in 2015,
OL,14,Fhe was just 30-years-old.
OL,16,FSince that day Clive's rallied for a
OL,17,Freview by the FA and football league
OL,18,Fbodies in to the proximity of walls
OL,19,Fand concrete perimeters around pitches
OL,20,Fat an amateur level and inside
OL,21,Ffootball stadiums.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1786268950
OL,3,CSolid perimeter walls around pitches
OL,4,Cbanned after death of Billy Vigar
OL,6,F"It gives me and the family a lot of
OL,7,Fsatisfaction and although it has taken
OL,8,Fa bit of time coming, I think for the
OL,9,FFA and the Premier League to get
OL,10,Ftogether and deal with this is the
OL,11,Fbest news given the situation," he
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,F"It is integral to the health and
OL,15,Fsafety of football. It feels like an
OL,16,Fhistoric day, we will remember today's
OL,17,Fdate and we can move on and forward.
OL,19,F"If this means people playing football
OL,20,Fcan go out and play on a weekend and
OL,21,Fthen come home again it is a big day."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/13
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
